@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
title Behavior - Move item to another valid parent
actor "Authorized user" as actor
box "Frontend - Mission Control application" #E0F2FE
  participant "WorkItemDetailPage or WorkHierarchyPage / ReparentDialog / ReparentForm" as page
  participant "IWorkItemService / WorkItemService" as client
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Api" #D1FADF
  participant "CurrentAccountAuthorization" as access
  participant "WorkItemsController" as ctrl
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "ValidationBehavior" as validation
  participant "ReparentWorkItemCommandHandler" as handler
  participant "WorkItem" as entity
end box
box "Backend - MissionControl.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "Mission Control SQL" as db
end box
actor -> page : Choose "Move to another parent" on an epic, story, or task (the view's actionRequested with its WorkItemTarget)
page -> client : ReparentForm's workItemResource reads GetWorkItemQuery for the current path and version; Move stays disabled (loading)
alt Read fails (500 or 503 with correlation ID, or no response)
  client --> page : Move stays disabled; alert with Try again = reload(), Cancel, and the reference ID only when the server answered; focus moves to Try again (load-failed)
else Read 404: the item was deleted after the page loaded
  client --> page : "No longer exists" with Back to work, no reference ID or Try again (not-found); Back to work emits notFound; the dialog closes with NotFound; the page calls the layout's refresh(), and the detail page opens the work outline
else Item read
  client --> page : Show the current path from its ancestors; the expected version comes from it
end
page -> page : Targets read GetWorkItemsQuery for the required parent type and search text matching a title or parent title (debounced about 250 ms, older read cancelled), bounded pages; each target shows its parent's title and child count; a status region announces the match count, zero matches show "No epics match" with Clear search (no-match state); current parent unavailable
opt Targets read fails (500, 503, or no response)
  page -> page : Field-level alert under the search with Retry = targets reload(), and the reference ID only when the server answered; the current path, any chosen target, and its path preview stay, so Move remains available (targets-failed state)
end
opt Cancel, Close, or Escape after choosing a target
  page -> page : The chosen target is a dirty draft: UnsavedChangesDialog asks first; Discard closes and sends nothing
end
actor -> page : Pick a target, review the path preview, and confirm
page -> page : Disable Move while pending (L2-031)
page -> client : Build typed ReparentWorkItemCommand (target parent, expected item version)
client -> access : PUT /api/workspaces/{id}/work-items/{itemId}/parent
access -> access : L2-002 validate signature, issuer, audience, subject, expiry
access -> db : Read current status, role and credential version
db --> access : Current account access
alt Missing, invalid or expired JWT; deactivated account
  access --> client : 401; audit denial without payloads
  client --> page : sessionInterceptor calls SessionService.end(Unauthorized) once for this generation; the promise rejects with its 401 (nothing written); sign-in shows session-unsaved when a draft was dirty, then returns to the item
else Authenticated active account (profile P: moving work needs no capability beyond an active session)
  access -> ctrl : Authorized request
  ctrl -> validation : Send ReparentWorkItemCommand through MediatR 12.5.0
  validation -> validation : Target identifier present and well formed (a malformed path ID matches no route and returns 404)
  alt Malformed request
    validation --> ctrl : 400 field errors; nothing read or changed
    ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails
    client --> page : Keep the dialog open; focus moves to the target choices, which read the field message; no Retry or reference ID
  else Valid request
    validation -> handler : Handle ReparentWorkItemCommand
    handler -> db : BeginWorkspaceTransactionAsync takes the workspace lock first; then LoadWorkItemAsync for the item, target, and (for a task) source story; LoadSiblingOrderAsync for the source and target sibling orders
    db --> handler : Current hierarchy state, or lock-wait timeout
    alt Workspace lock wait times out
      handler --> ctrl : 503 with Retry-After; nothing read or changed
      ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (unavailable)
      client --> page : Unavailable save, as for a 500: nothing moved; keep the choice; alert with reference ID; focus stays on Move, which resends only when chosen (failed state)
    else Workspace or item not found
      handler --> ctrl : 404; nothing changed
      ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (not found)
      client --> page : The not-found presentation, whose Back to work emits notFound; the dialog closes with NotFound; the page calls the layout's refresh(), and the detail page opens the work outline
    else Stale item version (L2-041)
      handler --> ctrl : 409 stale version; nothing changed
      ctrl --> client : ProblemDetails (changed)
      client --> page : Keep the dialog; "This story changed" alert; Move becomes unavailable, so focus moves to Reload story, which calls reload() on the item and target resources, reading the current parent, version, and targets without resending (conflict state)
    else Target missing or deleted, wrong level, current parent, initiative item, or other workspace (L2-016.4)
      handler --> ctrl : 400 invalid target; old hierarchy intact
      ctrl --> client : Validation ProblemDetails (target field)
      client --> page : Keep the dialog; drop a deleted target from the choices and clear the selection; focus moves to the target choices, which read the field error; no Retry or reference ID (rejected state)
    else Move permitted
      handler -> entity : L2-016 change only the parent link; append after the target's existing children
      entity --> handler : Same IDs, fields, descendants, and sprint membership under the new path
      handler -> db : L2-039 / L2-040 AddAuditEvent, then SaveChangesAsync: update item, compact source siblings, append target sibling, bump both sibling-order versions, for a task increment both stories' task revisions only (their versions and sprint versions unchanged), success audit
      alt Commit fails
        db --> handler : Roll back business state and success audit
        handler --> ctrl : Generic 500 with correlation ID
        ctrl --> client : Failure; no successful-save claim
        client --> page : Nothing moved; keep the choice; alert with reference ID; focus stays on Move, which retries the same request only when chosen (failed state)
      else Commit succeeds
        db --> handler : New item version and sibling-order versions
        handler --> ctrl : Moved item with new path
        ctrl --> client : 200
        client --> page : ReparentForm emits moved; the dialog closes with Moved(moved, title)
        page -> page : The page increments its refresh counter: every expanded branch rereads, including the source and target parents, or the detail rereads with its new path
        page --> actor : The "Moved" toast names the item and its new parent; focus returns to the item's actions, or to the source parent's row when the item left the loaded outline
      end
    end
  end
end
opt No response to the move (timeout or network failure)
  client --> page : The move may have committed: keep the chosen target; the failed alert reads "We couldn't confirm whether the story moved" without a reference ID; ReparentForm calls reload() on the item and target resources once, so the current path shows whether it moved, and emits unconfirmed, which the dialog relays so the page rereads its view at once; when the reread shows the item already under the chosen target, that target is its current parent and can't be chosen, so the selection clears and Move stays unavailable; nothing says the story didn't move; otherwise Move resends only when pressed
end
note over ctrl, db
An unexpected 403 moves nothing; ReparentForm keeps the choice and emits forbidden, ReparentDialog relays it, and the routed page shows the "Your access changed" toast through TOAST_SERVICE, without Retry or reference ID; the capability refresh still runs.
All rejection checks run under the lock before any write.
Unexpected failures return generic 500 plus correlation ID (L2-043).
Diagnostics exclude secrets and contact payloads.
end note
@enduml
